<title>BELGIUM: EU reviews beet sugar producer/processor contracts.</title>
<headline>EU reviews beet sugar producer/processor contracts.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission this week issued a progress report on a review of contract arrangements between sugar processors and beet producers, EU sources said.</p>
<p>They said the Commission told this week's meeting of the EU sugar management committee that it was still waiting for both sides to formally express their views before proposing a revision of EU regulation 206/68.</p>
</text>
